    "content": "Hi! I'm Abhilasha! I'm a software developer currently studying for a Masters in Computer Engineering at UCF. In 2024, I graduated from NYU with a Bachelor's in Computer Science and Mathematics. I'm a programmer, math nerd, animal lover, digital artist, amateur cook, aspiring web dev, and tabletop role playing game afficionado.\n\nI created this website to showcase my interests and projects, ranging from art to computing to anything else that I may be interested in at the moment. It will contain various web apps and documentation about projects I've worked on. As of now the site in is a very preliminary state, but it will be updated with more content soon. Check back later to see what I've added!",
